    S -->|No - Error| V[Response Header: errorCode + messages<br/>Body: solicitudTCResponse vacío]
    
    U --> W[Cliente recibe SOAP Response]
    V --> W
    
    subgraph Error Handler Global
        X[Excepción no controlada] --> Y[successIndicator = fault/errorCode<br/>messages = fault/reason<br/>Body: solicitudTCResponse vacío]
        Y --> W
